[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11400.71, "timestamp": "03:10:00", "text": "但纤维含量不够。我会得到更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11402.79, "timestamp": "03:10:02", "text": "没有理由。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11405.429, "timestamp": "03:10:05", "text": "完全没有任何理由。让我做一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11408.95, "timestamp": "03:10:08", "text": "用鱼叉我去捕些鱼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11410.79, "timestamp": "03:10:10", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11412.55, "timestamp": "03:10:12", "text": "好了，我现在有一根长矛了。我要走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11424.389, "timestamp": "03:10:24", "text": "耶！把这个放在这里。就是这个。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11430.71, "timestamp": "03:10:30", "text": "哦，是的。昨天我们就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11432.87, "timestamp": "03:10:32", "text": "像第一次玩那样去玩，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11435.99, "timestamp": "03:10:35", "text": "正确的？玩游戏。所以，它提醒了我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11438.95, "timestamp": "03:10:38", "text": "让我想起我正在写的故事，因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11441.269, "timestamp": "03:10:41", "text": "故事就发生在这样一个岛屿上……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11443.03, "timestamp": "03:10:43", "text": "出色地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11445.19, "timestamp": "03:10:45", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11448.15, "timestamp": "03:10:48", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11450.07, "timestamp": "03:10:50", "text": "嘿，到底是关于什么的？是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11451.91, "timestamp": "03:10:51", "text": "是关于什么的？它应该是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11454.95, "timestamp": "03:10:54", "text": "幻想。就像我曾经写过的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11458.07, "timestamp": "03:10:58", "text": "大概40页或50页吧，但后来我想……"}]